# Python (the prototype twins in experiments/ordering; see CLAUDE.md, Tooling).
# No pyproject.toml and no venv today, the layers being stdlib-only scripts run
# by a bare python3, but bytecode appears as soon as one is run, and .venv/ would
# appear if a dependency ever arrives and the folder becomes a uv project.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

